{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_001_06_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:fdb3fe96382f9a5c6c3821ccb9243461535d52b3942b736574f6101978fd72f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9a9fc9228e5cc694eb722aa57f947dbc3bcd0280c41399bcac4644f73b4b0fd",
      "text": "啊，您能喜欢真是再好不过了。\n其实这道茶，正是本店最为推荐的调配茶……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e116602d321310ab73866cb987037b56ef7bf39529a7beb3518c55b2e8b7901b",
      "text": "（大家都在笑着享受呢。\n能举办感谢祭真是太好了。……话说回来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07759e4355daebe398f5d57d7383fa2b9e644860cc5253828cedc195f5576250",
      "text": "（是因为信的那件事吗。\n和粉丝们在一起的时候）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebd74ba78a3eee3bd906b51839f7a6c66c8994ae352bebe38d36f7378ee82316",
      "text": "（总会忍不住想起，\n无法像这样相互理解的家人……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:120a2e6693effcfbabf751be9c7bc4889dba7b19e1a7f97df5931741ecc945e3",
      "text": "（……有朝一日，吾也能有时间与同族\n如此促膝长谈吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cba5fa232f76a0dc3dee6c6961228670b1db17f351cd2a85fe95559cf3f2422",
      "text": "（想走上西点之路……我这样的梦想，\n会有得到认可的那一天吗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9fd926022f18cd46b02fdd01592bd95d0330e20e1b2b1399409486d70cce788",
      "text": "（关于我真正喜欢的东西，\n能好好聊一聊的那一天会到来吗……？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a94054bf29cc117866778dda901dda20996c906f3c8c3d83fc0d98058830cfd",
      "text": "（不行不行。马上就要到Live的时间了。\n现在必须全力以赴让客人们尽兴才行！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000122:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f0e92f217f01dba89d0ea4719b7028cb261b452bfd173bc21008220bdd6c26",
      "text": "Live结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000133:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9df2b1fadc1b406253657694562b561592ec56ce497462a932a7d8807cffcff5",
      "text": "……Live大获成功呢！\n大家都在笑着为我们应援。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000140:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae1571c5f11647edd319d3caf162efa214199b6aad0e64544ae2133a5714972",
      "text": "唔！吾等的咏唱，\n竟能让他们如此欣喜……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000150:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f12d3f123947e68cf91b86158217273b31a65c75fd3f4eb11a5c4342b61c33a",
      "text": "……我啊，站在舞台上之后，\n重新意识到了一件事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000154:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395f7082b97b37c994947c703c88771c979abafbf4fcc17247426afaaa76fd55",
      "text": "Cafe Parade是能让我们保持自我、展现本色的\n另一个容身之所。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000158:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97bd44c8f3543bb247f8e260d9a2541ae1f1d569eb51089c0c75ab9975a7defa",
      "text": "还有就是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000162:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:897944517336f28e37ae8758042bdf0738e8cc573cc193ab027f3f1f6c6d0761",
      "text": "汇聚了这样的我们的Cafe Parade，\n拥有让人感到幸福的力量！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a45e737cefdcceeaa6c65170706f22f238027916c3a764c81f05f91c68cc7384",
      "text": "……啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000219:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bec5451b9231aa25bb3e6907f3a1b29f64af6eedb97dd5c9de99dc63ce18b58a",
      "text": "（我也许依然还是那个任性的小孩……\n但是）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000223:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4eef2ca436091eecfc8003e44de4faaac1cb57617a84940d9b961ddae554b6d",
      "text": "（从Cafe Parade将幸福传递给全世界。\n我想继续追逐属于自己的这份梦想……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000244:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d6af8bb6daebacbdd25cd1751ef49a3affd71f461e2c3df0d84baf1199c3dfd",
      "text": "……咲酱，我也是这么想的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_001_06:1_4_001_06_h:cmd-000252:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43452183f453bb4987204b206d6adda3cbd9363fe01137d4946f94eae9e59b8a",
      "text": "今后也一起创造出\n更多的笑容与幸福吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
